  "face_design_final": "Face — her own structure, not the style's default face: oval face, balanced length, medium width; soft rounded jaw; open rounded eyes, medium size, level outer corners, wide-set; fine soft arches; long nose with low tip; small mouth.\nHair: bob.\nImpression (reads even at card size): a cool, composed woman in her early twenties; a level, unbothered gaze; sapphire blue eyes; a thin, sharp eyeliner.\nIdentity (chosen details override the automatic look)\nbody type: an hourglass figure with a subtly full bust, a slim waist and very wide, curvy rounded hips that flow smoothly into softly full thighs, the line tapering gradually toward the knees with no sudden narrowing below the hips, and slender lower legs — never thick or heavy\nbody scope: Body type sets the build; body details adjust within it. These describe anatomy beneath armor, not equipment volume.\nProportions: natural adult proportions — about 7.5 heads tall, her head in proportion to her shoulders and body. Her worn features are costume, never extra limbs.\nBody: a normal human body — elbows, knees and wrists bend the human way. Hands and feet may be partly hidden by the pose, what she holds or the frame.\nHands: Keep both hands relaxed — a loose fist, an open palm or resting on something. Gloves are full-finger and close-fitting; plates, water, sparks and effects stay off the fingers.\nAnatomy: one head, two arms and two legs, each joined at its natural joint; natural hands with five fingers.\n\n",
